<title>POLAND: GPRD SETS PAYOUT RECORD DATE AT MAY 15.</title>
<headline>GPRD SETS PAYOUT RECORD DATE AT MAY 15.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish road builder Gdanskie Przedsiebiorstwo Robot Drogowych SA (GPRD) set the record date for its planned payment of 1.1 million zlotys in 1996 dividends for May 15, the company said in a statement on Thursdsay.</p>
<p>GPRD said the pay date would be July 10 and that 5.5 million zlotys of its 7.1-million-zloty net profit last year would go to reserve capital. The rest would go to a social fund for employees.</p>
<p>Shareholders of GPRD, which has 7.5 million shares outstanding, will vote on the proposal on April 26.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
